{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2023-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1676419200, "end_date": 1677023999, "month_true_total": 291, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:51:18 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "133283400", "author": {"steamid": "76561198002704815", "personaname": "Yuri Bezmenov", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sdfsdfuyg343478fg6hdrfhgosth8/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 152, "playtime_forever": 398, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 376, "last_played": 1765283621, "avatar": "76d6c46a7b9a948f169c834346e7cb863874e793"}, "language": "english", "review": "[b]\"Connection Timeout, Check your Network Error\"[/b] is my ultimate multiplayer experience with this game. I cannot recommend this game in good conscience. If you are looking for a purely flawless multiplayer game I suggest another game.\n\nIn a game where at least 3000 active players are playing:\n-I cannot find a matchmaking, so I'm sent into a squad.\n-While waiting 7 minutes for people to come I start having people send to my squad.\n-When we're full and ready I hit the button Start and a few seconds pass I get the wonderful message \"Connection Timeout, Check your Network Error\".\n\nEvery single time I try to play multiplayer this happens.\n\nBecause of this, I am not able to play multiplayer. And if devs don't improve the multiplayer problems, I probably never will. The game is cute tho. But I'm sure I'll have a fun time with people around.\n\nI'll keep the comments open in case anyone has the same problem as me and found a solution.", "timestamp_created": 1676971789, "timestamp_updated": 1676983612, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.478510946035385132", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "ap